  - Include pediatric RCTs/quasi-RCTs of cotrimoxazole prophylaxis vs placebo/no treatment.
  - Exclude adult trials, observational studies, non-randomized, diagnostic/case series, and reviews.
- Determine the number of candidate studies (from the provided list) for reporting.
- Determine the number of included studies after screening (likely only study 1 based on abstracts).
